40
00:01:37,441 --> 00:01:39,486
it gives up downforce to cut drag

41
00:01:39,486 --> 00:01:41,470
when the car does not need grip.

42
00:01:41,819 --> 00:01:45,005
Auto Bild, in September twenty eighteen,

43
00:01:45,005 --> 00:01:48,031
