44
00:01:48,211 --> 00:01:51,287
Front flaps closed give maximum downforce.

45
00:01:51,467 --> 00:01:54,085
Front flaps open give lower drag,

46
00:01:54,085 --> 00:01:57,098
for higher top speed and acceleration.

47
00:01:57,278 --> 00:01:59,504
The enlarged rear wing is part of

48
00:01:59,504 --> 00:02:02,202
the system, and the roadster would later

49
00:02:02,202 --> 00:02:04,495
get an update called ALA two point

50
00:02:04,495 --> 00:02:04,697
oh.

51
